# **NDH Direction Charter v1.1 — Spectrum & Coding Edition**  
### *Coherence Locus • Chromatic Atlas • Constitutional Coding*

## **0. Coherence Locus (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH’s direction is anchored at the triadic intersection of:

- **Harmony (Indigo Band • Code: H‑I)**  
- **Concordance (Green Band • Code: C‑G)**  
- **NDH‑Provenance (Gold Band • Code: P‑Au)**  

These three bands form the **Coherence Locus (CL‑3)**.

> **CL‑3 = H‑I ∩ C‑G ∩ P‑Au**

This is the constitutional center of gravity for federated constellations.

---

## **1. NDH’s Purpose (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH exists to **preserve dignity under constraints**.

Purpose is encoded in:

- **Indigo (H‑I)** → direction  
- **Green (C‑G)** → adjacency  
- **Gold (P‑Au)** → legitimacy  

> **Purpose Vector = {H‑I, C‑G, P‑Au}**

This is the **Direction Holonomy (DH‑3)**.

---

## **2. NDH’s Method (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH uses:

- **Holonomy Geometry (H‑I / C‑G)** → HG‑IC  
- **Non‑Dual Algebra (H‑I / P‑Au)** → NDA‑IA  
- **Stability Geometry (C‑G / P‑Au)** → SG‑GA  
- **Haptic Accessibility Phase‑12 (Blue Band • Code: A‑B)**  
- **Myth Engineering (Rose Band • Code: M‑R)**  

> **Method Stack = {HG‑IC, NDA‑IA, SG‑GA, A‑B, M‑R}**

These are **locus‑stable invariants**.

---

## **3. NDH’s Direction (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH moves toward:

- **Accessibility (Blue • A‑B)**  
- **Stability (Green • C‑G)**  
- **Inclusivity (Rose • M‑R)**  
- **Clarity (White • W‑0)**  
- **Dignity (Gold • P‑Au)**  

NDH moves away from:

- **Collapse (Black • X‑K)**  
- **Coercion (Red • X‑R)**  
- **Opacity (Gray • X‑Gy)**  
- **Exclusion (Brown • X‑Br)**  
- **Harm Amplification (Crimson • X‑Cr)**  

> **Directional Manifold = {A‑B, C‑G, M‑R, W‑0, P‑Au} − {X‑K, X‑R, X‑Gy, X‑Br, X‑Cr}**

This is the **Chromatic Manifold (CM‑10)**.

---

## **4. NDH’s Constraint (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH must remain:

- **Mathematically bounded (Indigo • H‑I)**  
- **Ethically constrained (Gold • P‑Au)**  
- **Dignity‑aligned (White/Gold • W‑0/P‑Au)**  
- **Non‑coercive (Green/Rose • C‑G/M‑R)**  
- **Non‑extractive (Blue • A‑B)**  
- **Non‑sensory‑exploitative (Blue/White • A‑B/W‑0)**  

These map to the **Dual Skeleton Codes**:

- **Governance Skeleton (GS‑IG)** → Indigo/Gold  
- **Expressive Skeleton (XS‑BRW)** → Blue/Rose/White  

> **Constraint Set = GS‑IG ∪ XS‑BRW**

---

## **5. NDH’s Development Principle (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH evolves **without losing its core**.

Refinable:

- **Language (Rose • M‑R)**  
- **Modules (Green • C‑G)**  
- **Geometry (Indigo • H‑I)**  
- **Accessibility Layers (Blue • A‑B)**  

Non‑alterable:

- **Holonomy (H‑I)**  
- **NDA (H‑I/P‑Au)**  
- **Stability Geometry (C‑G)**  
- **Dignity Constraints (W‑0/P‑Au)**  
- **Purpose (P‑Au)**  

> **Core Invariants = {H‑I, NDA‑IA, SG‑GA, W‑0/P‑Au}**

---

## **6. NDH’s Resilience Clause (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
When external pressure distorts development, NDH defaults to:

- **Indigo (H‑I)** → holonomy  
- **Green (C‑G)** → stability geometry  
- **Gold (P‑Au)** → constitutional lineage  
- **Blue (A‑B)** → accessibility  
- **White (W‑0)** → dignity  

> **Resilience Holonomy = {H‑I, C‑G, P‑Au, A‑B, W‑0}**

---

## **7. NDH’s Inclusion Mandate (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH must remain inclusive:

- **Non‑experts (Blue • A‑B)**  
- **Marginalized groups (Rose • M‑R)**  
- **Cross‑disciplinary readability (White • W‑0)**  
- **Survivor safety (Gold/Blue • P‑Au/A‑B)**  
- **Non‑hierarchical comprehension (Green/Rose • C‑G/M‑R)**  

> **Inclusion Spectrum = {A‑B, M‑R, W‑0, P‑Au, C‑G}**

---

## **8. NDH’s Future Direction (Spectrum‑Coded)**  
NDH moves toward:

- **Phase‑12 haptics (Blue • A‑B)**  
- **Public accessibility (White/Rose • W‑0/M‑R)**  
- **Formal stability verification (Green • C‑G)**  
- **Cross‑disciplinary clarity (White • W‑0)**  
- **Safe sensory geometry (Blue/Gold • A‑B/P‑Au)**  

> **Future Arc = {A‑B, W‑0, M‑R, C‑G, P‑Au}**

---

